1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,090
I think everyone can share the
footage.

2
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:07,930
Each person might edit it
differently.

3
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:10,990
It doesn’t have to become just one
film.

4
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:14,070
Or just the film I have in mind.

5
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:17,910
Maybe those two will make their
own film.

6
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:21,490
The footage is shared. That
matters too.

7
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:26,010
We could end up with many films.
You could make one too.

8
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:29,130
Sure, everyone can edit the
material.

9
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:35,290
But producing that material is a
different process…

10
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:37,490
Power has to be centralized?

11
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:38,770
Yes.

12
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:42,676
Then I still need a say.
